yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vagrant VM state -- per-machine, must not travel between laptops
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vagrant/
*.box

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Full database dumps (pg_dump). Used to carry real data between the owner's own
# machines (e.g. a laptop switch) via OneDrive, since this repo folder already
# lives under OneDrive -- NOT for git. A dump contains bcrypt password hashes and
# Fernet-ciphertext credentials; low risk on their own, but a full DB export has no
# business in a public GitHub repo regardless. See README "Moving to a new machine".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dump

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Collected audit evidence -- DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED.
#
# Spec Section 11: small evidence artifacts (e.g. phase1_raw_output.json) are part
# of the audit trail this project exists to produce, and are fine to commit. Only
# multi-megabyte or regenerable machine output is excluded -- see *.box above and
# build/ below.
#
# Caveat for later phases: these files contain the full configuration of whatever
# host was audited. Harmless for the throwaway demo VM. If this tool is ever pointed
# at a real production server, the resulting evidence file is a detailed map of that
# host's weaknesses and should not land in a shared repository without thought.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

